 History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1989,"end":2001,"desc":"Mientras las revistas anuncian la «muerte del punk», el hardcore se convierte en un movimiento que no deja pueblo sin tocar y genera subgéneros. El «emocore» (Jawbreaker, Weezer, Sunny Day Real Estate, Promise Ring, At The Drive-In, Jimmy Eat World, Seaweed); el hardcore progresivo de Washington (Nation Of Ulysses, Make-Up, Shudder To Think, Jawbox, Edsel, Lungfish, Circus Lupus, Dismemberment Plan); el «ska-core» (Operation Ivy, Rancid, Mighty Mighty Bosstones, Sublime, No Doubt); el punk-pop que llega a las listas (Green Day, Offspring, Flop, Pennywise, Pegboy, Superchunk, Queers); el garage-punk californiano (Drive Like Jehu, Rocket From The Crypt, Blink 182, Zen Guerrilla); el jazzcore (Bazooka, Iceburn); la vieja escuela (D Generation, Supersuckers, Zeke, Dropkick Murphys, Silverfish, Turbonegro) y el post-hardcore de Unwound.","color":"#fb7185","family":"Punk, new wave, hardcore y noise","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#punk-pop-90s"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":222684035088039,"artist":"Unwound","artist_id":256198492456406,"title":"Fake Train","year":1993,"ess":1,"yt":"4EPWEVlSo7Q","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Hardcore en la era del punk-pop: emocore, ska-core y post-hardcore","scene_id":133100657668392,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#punk-pop-90s","chapters":["Sección 6.15"],"pages":[[1,285,null]]},{"id":97661049440635,"artist":"Unwound","artist_id":256198492456406,"title":"New Plastic Ideas","year":1994,"ess":0,"yt":"VOloYTXAU_U","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Hardcore en la era del punk-pop: emocore, ska-core y post-hardcore","scene_id":133100657668392,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruf